- R5: npm --prefix packages/mcp-server run test:safety, node packages/core/test/run-command-revision-test.js and node packages/core/test/run-lock-test.js. Include exact-once effects, pending/uncertain original-operation observation, deadlines/cancellation, confirmed termination and lock ownership. No fake receipt rewriting to obtain a pass.
